{
"content_id": "797933",
"reference_id": 18453,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "約拿書 1:4",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "32001004",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>神對自然界的掌權是整卷約拿書中的一個重要主題（見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32001004\" data-end-ref=\"32001004\">拿1:4</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32001009\" data-end-ref=\"32001009\">9</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32001013\" data-end-ref=\"32001016\">13–16</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32001017\" data-end-ref=\"32001017\">17</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32002003\" data-end-ref=\"32002003\">2:3</data>、<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32002010\" data-end-ref=\"32002010\">10</data>，<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32004006\" data-end-ref=\"32004007\">4:6–7</data>）。</p>",
"associations": {
