{
"content_id": "797935",
"reference_id": 18455,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "約拿書 1:7–8",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "32001007-32001008",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<ul><li><p>神允許人在某些特定情況下使用籤（見<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03016008\" data-end-ref=\"03016008\">利16:8</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"06018006\" data-end-ref=\"06018006\">書18:6</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"13026012\" data-end-ref=\"13026016\">代上26:12–16</data>；<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44001026\" data-end-ref=\"44001026\">徒1:26</data>）；然而，古代世界普遍所行的占卜，卻是耶和華所厭惡的（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05018009\" data-end-ref=\"05018013\">申18:9–13</data>）。</p></li><li><p><span>看看這災臨到我們是因誰的緣故（和合本譯為：</span>為要查出誰觸怒了神明<span>）</span>：在古近東，人們普遍認為不幸是因為觸犯了某位神明所致。</p></li></ul>",
"associations": {
"passage": [
{
"start_ref": "32001007",
"start_ref_usfm": "JON 1:7",
"end_ref": "32001008",
"end_ref_usfm": "JON 1:8"
}
