{
"content_id": "797956",
"reference_id": 18476,
"version": "1.0.4",
"title": "約拿書 4:4",
"media_type": "Text",
"index_reference": "32004004",
"language": "zht",
"review_level": "None",
"content": "<p>耶和華的回應是一個修辭性問句，其隱含的答案是：「不，當然不應該！」接下來的實例教訓（<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"32004006\" data-end-ref=\"32004011\">4:6–11</data>）揭示了為什麼約拿不應該發怒。</p>",
